<title>POLAND: BYTOM 96 NET FALLS TO PLN 0.8 MLN.</title>
<headline>BYTOM 96 NET FALLS TO PLN 0.8 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-01-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results December</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>DECEMBER</p>
<p> Net loss		 0.48 vs   0.05 profit</p>
<p> Pre-tax loss	   0.73 vs   0.36 profit</p>
<p> Operating profit     0.03 vs   1.12</p>
<p> Sales		    5.56 vs   7.28</p>
<p>JANUARY-DECEMBER</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.83 vs   2.72</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 2.10 vs   4.63</p>
<p> Operating profit     9.00 vs   8.95</p>
<p> Sales		   83.72 vs  78.14</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish garment maker is Bytom SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
